  "authority": "work/records/2026/08/finding-v12-isolated-agent-workers/findings/finding-v12-local-isolated-execution/findings/finding-v12-worker-manager-core/FINDING.md#confirmed-decision--one-smaller-canonical-uri-grammar",
  "why": [
    "The frozen JavaScript constructor NORMALIZES: ten of nineteen forms it",
    "accepts come back as a different string. A durable locator whose meaning",
    "depends on a normalizing parser is one two conforming readers can disagree",
    "about, which is the failure \u00a73.3 exists to prevent. So both runtimes",
    "enforce this smaller grammar over the ORIGINAL TEXT instead, and this file",
    "is the authority for both -- not two implementations that agree today."
  ],
